<title>GERMANY: Linde says considering U.S. listing.</title>
<headline>Linde says considering U.S. listing.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>German forklift maker Linde AG said on Thursday it was considering a possible acquistion in the U.S. which under certain circumstances may require it to list its shares on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>Chief Executive Hans Meinhardt told a news conference that Linde did not plan to list its shares in the U.S. this year.</p>
<p>&quot;But under certain circumstances a listing there could be a precondition for our plans,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>Asked to elaborate, Meinhardt said he was referring to a possible acquistion.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom + 49 69 756525</p>
